  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f7953333-95b5-4b63-a1c9-2bbebd37c0c3-image.png\" style=\"width: 308px; height: 163px;\" /></p><p>We know that power factor is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>Z</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d2d7bbe6-599c-406b-a9ef-ac58611f3676-image.png\" style=\"width: 201px; height: 187px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
